#: WhatsNext.py:546
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ A local Genealogical Tree database has not yet been loaded.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Nid oes cronfa ddata Coeden Achau leol wedi'i llwytho eto.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:548
msgid " 👣 Next Steps:\n"
msgstr " 👣 Camau Nesaf:\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:549
msgid "  •  From the \"Family Trees\" menu,"
msgstr "  •  O'r ddewislen \"Coed Teulu\","

#: WhatsNext.py:550
msgid " use the \"Manage Family Trees...\" option to"
msgstr " defnyddiwch yr opsiwn \"Rheoli Coed Teulu...\" i"

#: WhatsNext.py:551
msgid " create a New (or to select an existing) Tree database.\n"
msgstr " greu cronfa ddata Coeden Newydd (neu i ddewis un sy'n bodoli).\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:552
msgid "  •  Click the \"Load Family Tree\" button to begin"
msgstr "  •  Cliciwch y botwm \"Llwytho Coeden Deulu\" i ddechrau"

#: WhatsNext.py:553
msgid ""
" working with the selected genealogical tree.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" gweithio gyda'r goeden achau a ddewiswyd.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:556
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"I ddefnyddio copi wrth gefn o Gramps, neu ffeil GEDCOM o offeryn achau arall, dewiswch \"Mewnforio...\" yn y ddewislen \"Coed Teulu\".\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:562
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, first create and load a new, empty tree. Then choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"I ddefnyddio copi wrth gefn o Gramps, neu ffeil GEDCOM o offeryn achau arall, crëwch a llwythwch goeden newydd, wag yn gyntaf. Yna dewiswch \"Mewnforio...\" yn y ddewislen \"Coed Teulu\".\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:622
msgid "Use the \"Configure\" in the \"View\" menu to change the Gramplet options."
msgstr ""
"Defnyddiwch \"Ffurfweddu\" yn y ddewislen \"Gweld\" i newid opsiynau'r "
"Gramplet."

