msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Anwybyddu"

#: WhatsNext.py:730
msgid "Tag to Ignore People and Families"
msgstr "Tagio i Anwybyddu Pobl a Theuluoedd"

#: WhatsNext.py:739
msgid "Prune"
msgstr "Tocio"

#: WhatsNext.py:741
msgid "Tag to Prune (exclude) listed People and Families from testing"
msgstr "Tagio i Docio (eithrio) y Bobl a'r Teuluoedd a restrwyd rhag profi"

#: WhatsNext.py:820
msgid "Search Quota "
msgstr "Cwota Chwilio "

#: WhatsNext.py:824
msgid ""
"The least number of lines to show. The search stops once this many problems "
"are found"
msgstr ""
"Y nifer lleiaf o linellau i'w dangos. Mae'r chwilio'n stopio pan ddeuir o "
"hyd i gynifer o broblemau"

#: WhatsNext.py:832
msgid "Depth per loop"
msgstr "Dyfnder fesul cylch"

#: WhatsNext.py:836
msgid ""
"How many generations of descendants to check before going up one more "
"generation of ancestors"
msgstr ""
"Sawl cenhedlaeth o ddisgynyddion i'w gwirio cyn mynd i fyny un genhedlaeth "
"arall o hynafiaid"

#: WhatsNext.py:844
msgid "Pause search expansion"
msgstr "Oedi ehangu'r chwilio"

#: WhatsNext.py:848
msgid ""
"How many extra rounds to wait after checking an ancestor before checking the"
" descendants of that ancestor"
msgstr ""
"Sawl rownd ychwanegol i aros ar ôl gwirio hynafiad cyn gwirio disgynyddion "
"yr hynafiad hwnnw"

#: WhatsNext.py:856
msgid "Complete tag"
msgstr "Tag Cwblhawyd"

#: WhatsNext.py:857
msgid "Finished. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr "Wedi gorffen. Cuddio'r gwrthrych, a pharhau i chwilio drwyddo"

#: WhatsNext.py:862
msgid "Ignore tag"
msgstr "Tag Anwybyddu"

#: WhatsNext.py:864
msgid "Set aside for now. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr ""
"Wedi'i roi o'r neilltu am y tro. Cuddio'r gwrthrych, a pharhau i chwilio "
"drwyddo"

#: WhatsNext.py:870
msgid "Prune tag"
msgstr "Tag Tocio"

#: WhatsNext.py:871
msgid "Dead end. Hide the object, and stop searching through it"
msgstr "Pen draw. Cuddio'r gwrthrych, a stopio chwilio drwyddo"

#: WhatsNext.py:888
msgid "Show suggested 👣 Next Steps"
msgstr "Dangos y 👣 Camau Nesaf a awgrymir"

#: WhatsNext.py:891
msgid ""
"Show the guidance steps and the 👣 suggestions. Turn off for a shorter list"
msgstr ""
"Dangos y camau arweiniad a'r 👣 awgrymiadau. Diffoddwch am restr fyrrach"

