#: WhatsNext.py:1613
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ The current Tree database contains no people.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Nid yw'r gronfa ddata Coeden gyfredol yn cynnwys unrhyw bobl.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1616
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
" Add a Family and a person in that family:\n"
"  • A Family may be added via the \"Add\" menu\n"
"  • A person may be added by pressing the \"+\" (plus) in the spouse (\"Father/partner1\" or \"Mother/partner2\") panels or \"Children\" tab.\n"
"\n"
"Or Import People from an external file:\n"
"  • An external file may be used to populate the tree via \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Camau Nesaf:\n"
" Ychwanegwch Deulu a pherson yn y teulu hwnnw:\n"
"  • Gellir ychwanegu Teulu drwy'r ddewislen \"Ychwanegu\"\n"
"  • Gellir ychwanegu person drwy bwyso'r \"+\" (plws) yn y paneli priod (\"Tad/partner1\" neu \"Mam/partner2\") neu'r tab \"Plant\".\n"
"\n"
"Neu Mewnforio Pobl o ffeil allanol:\n"
"  • Gellir defnyddio ffeil allanol i lenwi'r goeden drwy \"Mewnforio...\" yn y ddewislen \"Coed Teulu\"."

#: WhatsNext.py:1632
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ No Person has been chosen as the focal \"Home Person\".\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Nid oes Person wedi'i ddewis fel y \"Person Cartref\" canolog.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1635
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
"  •  Select the People view icon in the Navigator sidebar.\n"
"  •  Select someone to make them the \"Active Person\".\n"
"  •  Choose \"Set Home Person\" from the Edit menu or from the (right-click) context menu.\n"
"\n"
" This sets them as the focal \"Home Person\"."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Camau Nesaf:\n"
"  •  Dewiswch eicon y wedd Pobl ym mar ochr y Llywiwr.\n"
"  •  Dewiswch rywun i'w wneud yn \"Berson Gweithredol\".\n"
"  •  Dewiswch \"Gosod Person Cartref\" o'r ddewislen Golygu neu o'r ddewislen cyd-destun (clic de).\n"
"\n"
" Mae hyn yn ei osod fel y \"Person Cartref\" canolog."

